abstract: >-
  Code, exact experimental configurations and compact inputs for reproducing
  six main figures, supplementary figures S1–S15 and tables S1–S9 for the study
  of human-aligned gloss judgments in frozen InternVL and Qwen3 vision–language
  models. Shaobing Gao and Minjie Tan contributed equally; Shaobing Gao is the
  corresponding author. MIT applies to original project code only; third-party
  code and research assets retain their original rights and notices.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - gloss perception
  - vision-language models
  - behavioral alignment
  - representational similarity analysis
  - reproducible research
